      </categoryLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Auftragstaktik" id="dcbb-b9c1-4918-a274" hidden="false">
          <description>Once per Round, when this Admiral nominates Participating models for an Attack or Boarding action, they may nominate a single additional model from another friendly unit that shares its Positional Trait. This additional model cannot have the Flagship trait. All Participating models must have the Imperium trait, and must be within 15” of the Initial Target.

After the Action is resolved, perform a Group Crew Check for all Participating models. If the check is failed, they each gain 2 levels of Disorder. Otherwise, they gain 1 level of Disorder instead.

*Note: if a model Participates in an Attack action in which the unit chooses to Discharge Capacitors, do not convert strikes for the additional model’s Voltaic (X ) weapons. If the additional model’s unit is Charged, do not remove its Charge token.*</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </forceEntry>
