      <rules>
        <rule name="Pact-Sworn Sailors" id="1e24-fb25-6d88-e6ff" hidden="false">
          <description>All Teutonic units in this Force gain the Stoic property.

Once per Round, a single unit in this Force may perform the Charge Capacitors Special Action (see Voltaic (X ) in the Glossary of Special Rules &amp; Qualities), even if it has already Discharged Capacitors in that same activation.

 As an additional cost to do this, the controlling Admiral must Discard a Victory &amp; Valour Card from their hand.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </forceEntry>
