      <rules>
        <rule name="Draugr" id="ac1d-ac37-5ea4-a019" hidden="false">
          <description>Scions of Jutland models in this Force suffer the effects of Disorder as if they had one fewer level of it.

When a Scions of Jutland model Rallies and loses one or more levels of Disorder, this Admiral may choose an Enemy model within 8” of the Rallying model. The chosen Enemy model gains a single point of Disorder.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Mercenary Battlefleet" id="ba99-7504-f638-5e17" hidden="false">
          <description>A Fleet Doctrine cannot be purchased for this Battlefleet’s Flagship.


All non-Flagship units in this Battlefleet gain the Scions of Jutland trait.

Flagships in the Battlefleet may *not* have an attached Ferdinand Advanced Cruiser.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </forceEntry>
