              <rules>
                <rule name="SKEGGÖLD! SKÁLMÖLD! SKILDIR RO KLOFNIR!" id="6628-6cf2-388f-6612" hidden="false">
                  <description>This Doctrine can only be purchased for a Scandinavian Flagship unit.

During the Deploy Forces step, Scandinavian models in this Force may be Deployed anywhere on the table as long as they are wholly within 4” of their own Deployment Zone.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="INDUCTORIUM" id="d5b0-d823-8cf9-fd85" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="10" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="26e9-d432-42e8-875f" automatic="false" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Points" typeId="89fa-eeaa-958f-ca32" value="30"/>
                <cost name="VP per Model" typeId="c245-c6fc-adb8-407a" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <rules>
                <rule name="INDUCTORIUM" id="cae2-f77f-64d0-af7b" hidden="false">
                  <description>This Doctrine can only be purchased for a Imperium Flagship unit.

Once per Round, during the Inflict Damage step of an Attack action made by a unit in this Force that has scored at least one success, this Admiral can declare Inductorium. They can only do this if one or more of the Contributing Weapons have the Arc (X ) and/or Voltaic (X ) qualities.


If they declare Inductorium, the active Admiral chooses a point on the Initial Target. Every other model (friend or foe) that is within 3” of this point and shares a Positional Trait with the Initial Target suffers 1 Damage and 1 Disorder.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="TEUTONIC DISCIPLINE" id="113f-c640-3c6e-9c44" hidden="true" import="true" sortIndex="7" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="a229-ce98-ab87-d2df" automatic="false" field="selections" includeChildForces="true" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
