              </modifiers>
              <rules>
                <rule name="TEUTONIC DISCIPLINE" id="0141-8c3b-3fa9-2913" hidden="false">
                  <description>This Doctrine can only be purchased for a Teutonic Flagship unit. 


Once per Round, when a unit containing only Teutonic models is selected to Activate, this Admiral may declare Teutonic Discipline. 


If they do so, they secretly look at the top card of their Victory &amp; Valour Deck, then choose to either place it back on top, or place it at the bottom of the deck instead.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
